{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411100","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1341110001:1":{"text":"일이 끝나면 화이트마운틴을 떠날 건데, 다음엔 어디로 여행을 갈지 또 고민해야겠네요.","source_cn":"等打工结束我就准备离开白山，又得头疼接下来该去哪儿游历...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0664E487D5A2CB2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341110002:1":{"text":"라이세움에 간다고 했잖아요?","source_cn":"你之前不是打算去参观莱希拉姆吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8628DCC86F5D51ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341110003:1":{"text":"맞아요, 그렇긴 한데 여행에는 목적지가 하나뿐이면 안 되죠. 여러 가지 선택지가 있어야 해요!","source_cn":"确实如此，但游历怎么能只有一个目的地呢？得多列几个选项才行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x688618BAE77744B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341110004:1":{"text":"그렇게 많으면 최종 목적지는 어떻게 정할 건데요?","source_cn":"这么多选项，你怎么确定最终的地点呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77BE562209B2035E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341110005:1":{"text":"당연히 운명에 맡겨야죠! 주사위를 던질 거예요! 1이 나오면 라이세움, 2는 러스트 항, 3이면 반티스로 모험을 떠나고, 4면 땅거미 숲으로 돌아가 쉴 거예요!","source_cn":"那当然是交给命运——投骰子！投出1去莱希拉姆，2就去锈...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDD55273646E467B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1341110006:1":{"text":"그럼 과연 제 운명은... 아, 이런, 주사위가 온천에 빠졌어요!","source_cn":"让我看看命运的选择……啊，糟糕！骰子滚到温泉里了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76A7581C97D7836A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}